+  /**
+   * Caches results of {@link #queryThreadsSync} / {@link #queryMessagesSync} keyed by their exact
+   * query/filter parameters, so re-running an identical search (e.g. after clearing and retyping
+   * it, or navigating back to the chat list) skips the underlying scans entirely. Held statically,
+   * rather than per-instance, since a new {@link SearchRepository} is constructed on every screen
+   * that can search (chat list, contact pickers, etc.) -- a per-instance cache would only ever see
+   * one query and never pay off. Cleared in bulk on any conversation-list-relevant change instead
+   * of tracking per-query dependencies, since that's the only way to guarantee no stale results are
+   * ever shown.
+   */
+  private static final Map<ThreadCacheKey, ThreadSearchResult>   threadResultCache  = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
+  private static final Map<MessageCacheKey, MessageSearchResult> messageResultCache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
